        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Fusion F3-0 Round Tai Chi Bamboo Deadbolt</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAsian in design, this solid brass Fusion made deadbolt meets ANSI 156.5 Grade 2 criteria. The Tai Chi Deadbolt is available as either a single cylinder or a double cylinder. The medium bronze finish highlights the exotic look of this heavy duty deadbolt.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available Matching: <a href=\"/products/tai-chi-knobset-fusion-39-f3\"><b>Tai Chi Knobset</b></a> and <a href=\"/products/tai-chi-leverset-fusion-as-f3\"><b>Tai Chi Leverset</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Fusion F3 Deadbolt:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>1\" Throw Bolt With Interior Roll Pins</li>\r\n<li>Heavy-Duty strike with 3 screws for added security.</li>\r\n<li>Solid brass schlage SC1 keyway & 5 pin system.</li>\r\n<li>Meets ANSI 156.5 Grade 2 Criteria.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Diameter: 2-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Adjustable Door Thickness 1-3/8\" and 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Finish: <b>Medium Bronze</b></li>\r\n<li>Limited Lifetime Mechanical Warranty</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Single Cylinder -  The deadbolt is thrown and retracted by a key from exterior and by a thumb turn from the interior.</li>\r\n<li>Double Cylinder - The deadbolt is thrown and retracted by a key from both the exterior and the interior.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
